WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.590
Reading a page in Work.

00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:09.913
Put the sidebar away to read.

00:00:09.913 --> 00:00:22.775
Ask for a Launch section with the four docs.

00:00:22.775 --> 00:00:27.775
The assistant edits the workspace files.

00:00:27.775 --> 00:00:32.075
The sidebar changes in place; the page stays.

00:00:32.075 --> 00:00:35.075
The assistant explains what it changed.

00:00:35.075 --> 00:00:48.585
Ask for light mode, a calmer accent, a softer font.

00:00:48.585 --> 00:00:52.948
Put the chat away while it works.

00:00:52.948 --> 00:00:55.948
The assistant edits the theme file.

00:00:55.948 --> 00:00:59.748
Light mode, a new accent and font, in place.

00:00:59.748 --> 00:01:02.248
The bubble signals when it is done.

00:01:02.248 --> 00:01:06.888
Open the chat beside the page.

00:01:06.888 --> 00:01:29.493
Ask for a tool that reads your own chats.

00:01:29.493 --> 00:01:35.493
It writes a workflow and an app, then builds them.

00:01:35.493 --> 00:01:39.247
Put the chat away.

00:01:39.247 --> 00:01:42.385
Work asks once before the app reads your chats.

00:01:42.385 --> 00:01:49.288
The chat, back beside the app.
